window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-bddba8bbd58a93c8"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"annotate-scrna-seq-data\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"scrna-seq\">注释 scRNA-seq 数据</h1> <p>在同一聊天中审阅单细胞质控、注释和 UMAP 图。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT 和 NGS Analysis 插件，将 10x 风格矩阵包转换为经过质控筛选的单细胞产物、说明筛选阈值依据的摘要、注释结果和 UMAP 图，并可在同一聊天中检查和修改。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>在生成计数后进行矩阵层面质控、注释和可视化的单细胞团队。</li> <li>需要根据阈值解释过滤原因，并可审计哪些细胞被移除或标记的研究人员。</li> <li>希望获得便于审阅的可移交界面，其中包含生成的图表、可视化索引，以及 notebook 或应用交接的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>NGS Analysis（已阻止不安全链接）</td> <td>运行计数完成后的单细胞质控，并返回筛选、可视化、注释和 notebook 产物。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">起步提示词</h2> <p>运行 scRNA-seq 计数后质控</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">使用 NGS Analysis 插件。\n\n将此矩阵层面输入及指定的 10x 风格矩阵包、manifest 和数据集元数据，路由到 scrna-seq-qc。\n\n根据观察到的分布选择质控阈值，保留原始计数，并生成全局及分组 UMAP。\n\n返回：\n- summary.md\n- 质控摘要表，列出每项筛选移除或标记的细胞\n- 阈值选择依据图\n- 过滤后的 .h5ad\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/form/life-sciences-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">申请 GPT-Rosalind 访问权限（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"leverage-skills\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">使用技能</h2> <p>NGS Analysis 插件包含：</p> <ul> <li><code>ngs-analysis-router</code></li> <li><code>scrna-seq-qc</code></li> <li><code>ngs-scrna-seq</code></li> </ul> <p>使用该插件时，ChatGPT 可以调用这些打包好的技能。</p> <p><a id=\"step-by-step-guide\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">分步指南</h2> <ol> <li>将矩阵、条形码、基因或特征、manifest 和数据集元数据提供给 ChatGPT，或给出这些文件的准确路径。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，让 ChatGPT 根据观察到的分布选择质控阈值，并在运行产物中记录理由。</li> <li>打开可视化索引和审阅 notebook 或应用，检查质控通过/未通过数量、UMAP 图和注释置信度。</li> <li>在同一聊天中继续调整阈值、提供匹配的参考图谱，或在解除双细胞检测的阻塞后重新运行。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"results\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">结果</h2> <p>本次运行会生成用于审阅筛选决策的界面，而不只是一个过滤后的矩阵。先查看阈值选择依据图和质控摘要，了解每项筛选移除或标记了多少细胞，以及所选截断值是否符合观察到的分布。</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">审阅单细胞运行的阈值选择依据图及质控通过/未通过数量。 · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-1.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>审阅单细胞运行的阈值选择依据图及质控通过/未通过数量。 · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官网原始媒体</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>接着，按粗粒度标签和 Leiden 簇检查生成的 UMAP 图。这些视图有助于发现注释缺口、可疑簇或需要重新评估的阈值选择。</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">按粗粒度标签和 Leiden 簇检查 UMAP 图。 · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-2.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>按粗粒度标签和 Leiden 簇检查 UMAP 图。 · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官网原始媒体</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>最后，审阅细胞层面的指标和过滤结果。ChatGPT 会将此表与过滤后的 <code>.h5ad</code> 文件及可视化产物一并保留；你可以在同一聊天中调整阈值，同时保留第一轮判断的依据。</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">打开细胞层面的质控指标和过滤结果以供审阅。 · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-3.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>打开细胞层面的质控指标和过滤结果以供审阅。 · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">打开官网原始媒体</a></figcaption> </figure>","en":"<h1 id=\"annotate-scrna-seq-data\">Annotate scRNA-seq data</h1> <p>Review single-cell QC, annotations, and UMAPs in one chat.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT with the NGS Analysis plugin to turn a 10x-style matrix bundle into QC-filtered single-cell artifacts, threshold-justified filtering summaries, annotations, and UMAPs you can inspect and revise in the same chat.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Single-cell teams doing matrix-level QC, annotation, and visualization after count generation.</li> <li>Researchers who need threshold-justified filtering and an auditable record of cells removed or flagged.</li> <li>Teams that want a portable review surface with generated figures, a visualization index, and a notebook or app handoff.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>NGS Analysis (blocked unsafe link)</td> <td>Run single-cell post-count QC and return filtering, visualization, annotation, and notebook artifacts.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Run scRNA-seq Post-count QC</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use the NGS Analysis plugin.\n\nRoute this matrix-level input to scrna-seq-qc using the indicated 10x-style matrix bundle, plus the manifest and dataset metadata.\n\nChoose QC thresholds from the observed distributions, preserve raw counts, and generate global/per-group UMAPs.\n\nReturn:\n- summary.md\n- a QC summary table with cells removed or flagged per filter\n- threshold-justification plots\n- filtered .h5ad\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/form/life-sciences-access/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Request access to GPT-Rosalind (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"leverage-skills\">Leverage skills</h2> <p>The NGS Analysis plugin includes:</p> <ul> <li><code>ngs-analysis-router</code></li> <li><code>scrna-seq-qc</code></li> <li><code>ngs-scrna-seq</code></li> </ul> <p>When you use the plugin, ChatGPT can use all these packaged skills.</p> <h2 id=\"step-by-step-guide\">Step-by-step guide</h2> <ol> <li>Point ChatGPT to the appropriate matrix, barcodes, genes or features, manifest, and dataset metadata, or provide exact file references.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt so ChatGPT can choose QC thresholds from the observed distributions and record the rationale in the run artifacts.</li> <li>Open the visualization index and review notebook or app to inspect QC pass or fail counts, UMAPs, and annotation confidence.</li> <li>Continue in the same chat to refine thresholds, supply a matched reference atlas, or rerun after unblocking doublet detection.</li> </ol> <h2 id=\"results\">Results</h2> <p>The run produces a review surface for the filtering decisions, not just a filtered matrix. Begin with the threshold-justification plots and the QC summary so you can see how many cells each filter removed or flagged and whether the selected cutoffs match the observed distributions.</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">Review threshold-justification plots and QC pass or fail counts for a single-cell run. · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-1.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>Review threshold-justification plots and QC pass or fail counts for a single-cell run. · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open original media</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>Then inspect the generated UMAPs by coarse label and Leiden cluster. These views make it easier to identify annotation gaps, suspicious clusters, or threshold choices that need another pass.</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">Inspect UMAP plots by coarse label and Leiden cluster. · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-2.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>Inspect UMAP plots by coarse label and Leiden cluster. · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open original media</a></figcaption> </figure> <p>Finally, review the cell-level metrics and filtering outcomes. ChatGPT preserves this table with the filtered <code>.h5ad</code> and visualization artifacts so you can revise the thresholds in the same chat without losing the rationale for the first pass.</p> <figure> <p class=\"media-note\">Open cell-level QC metrics and filtering outcomes for review. · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-3.webp\">联网查看原始媒体</a></p> <figcaption>Open cell-level QC metrics and filtering outcomes for review. · <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scrna-seq-post-count-qc-screenshot-3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open original media</a></figcaption> </figure>"};
